for several new ops, including the lightning indexer, top-k mask, conv2d and upscale. \n API changes \n \n Add GGML_TYPE_F8_E4M3 (OCP FP8 E4M3) with float conversion helpers and GGML_FTYPE_MOSTLY_F8_E4M3 ( #27512 ) \n Add ggml_flash_attn_ext_rows() : FA variant where each q slice attends to its own K/V row list via index tensor ( #29510 ) \n Add batched ggml_backend_tensor_copy_n() , ggml_backend_tensor_set_n() and ggml_backend_tensor_get_n() APIs ( #30881 ) \n Add a multi-process communicator interface ( ggml_backend_comm_init_rank_t ) for collectives across separate ranks ( #28967 ) \n \n Core changes \n \n Bound tensor views by the bytes their strides reach and validate strided views against the source extent ( #31584 ) \n GGUF writer: write host-buffer tensor data directly to the output stream without an intermediate copy ( #31144 ) \n Use vm_allocate instead of posix_memalign for large allocations on all Apple platforms ( #31437 ) \n Meta backend: keep tensor splits across permuted views and avoid mirrored splits for ARANGE ( #30499 #30878 ) \n Speed up IQ4 quantization with pre-computed halfway points ( #31201 ) \n \n Backend changes \n CPU \n \n Add SVE 256-bit kernels: MXFP4 GEMV ( #28141 ), Q6_K GEMM ( #27472 ) and q8_0 4x8 GEMV ( #30585 ) \n Gate RVV code on the target vector extension so it is not built for rv64gc without V ( #31607 ) \n Implement ggml_flash_attn_ext_rows ( #29510 ) \n \n CUDA \n \n Add NCCL support for multi-node tensor parallelism via the multi-process communicator, used by the RPC server ( #28967 ) \n Gather batched tensor reads into mapped host memory for the batched copy APIs ( #31391 ) \n Fuse MoE ( MUL_MAT_ID ) gate/up projections with GLU in MMQ ( #31188 ) \n Implement ggml_flash_attn_ext_rows ( #29510 ) \n HIP: enable sparse attention on CDNA ( #31259 ) and add RDNA4_M family for gfx1170/gfx1171 ( #31373 ) \n Fix Q8_1 correction sum in MMQ ( #31247 ) and premature eviction of CUDA graphs ( #30662 ) \n \n SYCL \n \n Add DPAS flash attention kernel for q4_0/q8_0 KV caches on XMX ( #31125 ) \n Vectorize reordered-layout dequantization stores for Q4_0, K-quants, IQ3 and MXFP4 ( #30976 ) \n Add fast ggml_sycl_comm_exchange() for tensor parallelism ( #30956 ) \n Add work-group argmax for short TOP_K rows ( #31110 ) \n Fix f32 -> q2_0/q4_0/q5_0 rounding in CPY ( #31120 ) and FLASH_ATTN_EXT failures ( #30761 ) \n \n Metal \n \n Faster MXFP4 mat-vec; launch unary/binary/GLU kernels with full threadgroups ( #31075 ) \n Implement ggml_flash_attn_ext_rows ( #29510 ) \n Fix cpy kernel for destinations non-contiguous in dim 0 ( #31581 ) \n \n Vulkan \n \n Add tensor-parallel allreduce from shared host buffers ( #25051 ) \n Improve small-n split-K selection on RDNA3/RDNA4 ( #30146 ) and avoid redundant scans when zeroing skipped rows ( #31266 ) \n Skip the maxStorageBufferRange pre-check for non-compute tensors ( #31114 ) \n Fix out-of-bounds NVFP4 UE4M3 scale lookup ( #31079 ) \n \n OpenCL \n \n Add quantized GEMV/GEMM support for Q2_0, IQ1, IQ2, IQ3 and IQ4_XS ( #31340 #31341 #31267 #31338 #31339 ) \n Add tiled Q4_K GEMM and faster Q2_0 GEMV for Adreno ( #30412 #31577 ) \n Add FWHT-accelerated GEMM ( #31434 ) and TOP_K_MASK support ( #31441 ) \n \n Hexagon \n \n Add support for the LIGHTNING_INDEXER ( #31289 ), TOP_K_MASK ( #31552 ), UPSCALE ( #31331 ), CONV_2D ( #30995 ) and DSV4_HC_PRE/POST ( #30953 ) ops \n Faster TOP_K sampler ( #31279 ), block-based HVX IM2COL ( #31050 ), tiled HVX permute ( #31446 ) and better DDR use in transposed CONCAT ( #31277 ) \n Fix DMA transfers with strides larger than 24 bits ( #31442 ) \n \n Other backends \n \n ZDNN: share buffers with host ( #31481 ) and fix a fattn test failure ( #31583 ) \n WebGPU: add ARANGE support ( #31455 ) \n OpenVINO: slice view inputs of SCALE ( #31334 ) \n \n More info \n \n Releases and versioning of ggml-org projects \n \n Changelog since v0.28.0 \n 57e2c2c ggml : bump version to 0.29.0 ( #1680 ) \n 68d509f scripts : add ci-status.sh \n 689e0cb sync : llama.cpp \n f11cb47 ggml : Gate RVV code on the target extension (llama/31607) \n 5c9c721 sync : llama.cpp \n 71b8415 ggml : fix bf16 (llama/31609) \n b8f6efc opencl: improve q2_0 GEMV for Adreno (llama/31577) \n 682dfdd sync : llama.cpp \n 8bdd9c3 ggml: bound views by the bytes their strides reach (llama/31584) \n 02dcc21 ggml : write host-buffer tensor data directly in gguf writer (llama/31144) \n 0c4fecd hexagon: add LIGHTNING_INDEXER support (llama/31289) \n 492ed92 hexagon: add TOP_K_MASK op (llama/31552) \n d88c3d4 hexagon: faster TOP_K for the backend sampler (llama/31279) \n c8e848e hexagon: add DSV4_HC_PRE and DSV4_HC_POST ops (llama/30953) \n 6496f89 ggml-zdnn: fix fattn test failure (llama/31583) \n 781e018 ggml: avoid signed overflow in ggml_roll bounds check (llama/30375) \n 5d3c669 cuda: potential fix for Q8_1 correction sum (llama/31247) \n a044cd3 cuda : gather batched tensor reads into mapped host memory (PR to master) (llama/31391) \n 40c2633 Add nccl support for multi-node tensor parallelism (llama/28967) \n 1030236 meta: support GLM-5.3 next sm tensor (llama/30499) \n 7117df3 metal : fix cpy kernel for dst non-contiguous in dim 0 (llama/31581) \n b4134b7 vulkan: skip maxStorageBufferRange pre-check for non-compute tensors (llama/31114) \n f9be71f delta_net_base: refactor conv state (llama/30878) \n c44f602 vulkan: fix out-of-bounds NVFP4 UE4M3 scale lookup (llama/31079) \n e136ad2 cuda : prevent premature eviction of graphs about to be used (llama/30662) \n 43e15d2 opencl: add initial iq4_xs support (llama/31339) \n cb27aa1 webgpu: add ARANGE support (llama/31455) \n e96dee8 hexagon: tiled hvx permute (llama/31446) \n c33c20d llama : flash_attn_ext_rows - more efficient unified kv for multi-seq (llama/29510) \n 842f76b ggml-zdnn: share buffers with host (llama/31481) \n 643b9af ggml : use vm_allocate instead of posix_memalign on all Apple platforms (llama/31437) \n 2956e59 opencl: add topk_mask (llama/31441) \n aa632fc vulkan: add t