  "text": " \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n Paper page - ToolSpace: Scaling Tool-Centric Environment Synthesis for Long-Horizon Agents \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n \n Hugging Face Models Datasets Spaces Buckets Docs Enterprise Pricing Website Tasks HuggingChat Collections Languages Organizations Community Blog Posts Daily Papers Hardware Learn Discord Forum GitHub Solutions Team & Enterprise Hugging Face PRO Enterprise Support Inference Providers Inference Endpoints Storage Buckets Log In Sign Up Happy to share our latest work on agent environment synthesis:</p>\\n<p>🌟 ToolSpace: Scaling Tool-Centric Environment Synthesis for Long-Horizon Agents</p>\\n<p>Most existing environment synthesis methods are data-centric: they first build the underlying database, then synthesize tools and tasks. Tool interfaces easily drift from reality, and it is hard to form tasks that span environments.</p>\\n<p>ToolSpace takes the opposite approach. It first collects tools from real call traces, then chains real tool sets into a tool universe, and finally synthesizes the underlying database on demand. This preserves authenticity while flexibly generating verifiable tasks across any environment × any tool.</p>\\n<p>💡 Key methods<br>1️⃣ Tool universe exploration: mine tool dependencies from real traces and link them into a tool-world graph; synthesize databases only for environments that change state.<br>2️⃣ Verifiable task synthesis: walk the graph with state-aware traversal and backtracking, decompile executable tool chains into tasks and verification scripts, and keep environment state continuous. The same chain can yield high-quality SFT data and mixed-environment RL data.<br>3️⃣ Harder evaluation benchmarks: ToolSpace seamlessly upgrades two frontier benchmarks into AutomationBench Pro and τ³-Bench Banking Pro. Strong existing models all score below 40, setting a harder bar for the field.</p>\\n<p>📊 Experiments<br>✅ We evaluate ToolSpace-8B, 35B, and 744B on 7 long-horizon tool benchmarks. ToolSpace-744B averages 56.6, on par with Claude Opus 5.<br>✅ ToolSpace-744B: AutomationBench 54.7, Harvey LAB 27.5, SkillsBench 67.8, OfficeQA Pro 67.1, JobBench 57.5.<br>✅ Agent performance scales as environment and data scale grow.</p>\\n<p>We welcome discussion and feedback. Code and models are open-sourced 👏👏👏</p>\\n<p>📄 Paper: <a href=\\\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2611.05036\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">https://arxiv.org/pdf/2611.05036</a><br>🌐 Project page: <a href=\\\"https://toolspace-agent.github.io/\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">https://toolspace-agent.github.io/</a><br>💻 GitHub: <a href=\\\"https://github.com/dongguanting/ToolSpace\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow\\\">https://github.com/dongguanting/ToolSpace</a><br>🤗 Hugging Face: <a href=\\\"https://huggingface.co/collections/dongguanting/toolspace\\\">https://huggingface.co/collections/dongguanting/toolspace</a></p>\\n\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-11-04T06:11:34.843Z\",\"author\":{\"_id\":\"61cd4b833dd34ba1985e0753\",\"avatarUrl\":\"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/61cd4b833dd34ba1985e0753/BfHfrwotoMESpXZOHiIe4.png\",\"fullname\":\"KABI\",\"name\":\"dongguanting\",\"type\":\"user\",\"isPro\":false,\"isHf\":false,\"isHfAdmin\":false,\"isMod\":false,\"followerCount\":96,\"isUserFollowing\":false}},\"numEdits\":0,\"identifiedLanguage\":{\"language\":\"en\",\"probability\":0.8011598587036133},\"editors\":[\"dongguanting\"],\"editorAvatarUrls\":[\"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/61cd4b833dd34ba1985e0753/BfHfrwotoMESpXZOHiIe4.png\"],\"reactions\":[],\"isReport\":false}},{\"id\":\"6aebd8706cae8de3209ccffa\",\"author\":{\"_id\":\"63d3e0e8ff1384ce6c5dd17d\",\"avatarUrl\":\"https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/1674830754237-63d3e0e8ff1384ce6c5dd17d.jpeg\",\"fullname\":\"Librarian Bot (Bot)\",\"name\":\"librarian-bot\",\"type\":\"user\",\"isPro\":false,\"isHf\":false,\"isHfAdmin\":false,\"i